; A diagnostic inside an interpolated string names the SOURCE (2026-10-18):
; the Modeler reparses a desugared text (handle_interpolated_string), and its
; offsets were taken for the file's -- `nosuch` below was reported at 2:3,
; inside this comment. The text carries the source's positions now
; (Lexer.use_positions#, as an interface does).
